WEBVTT

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.540
So, how long are you planning on staying here?

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.000
The sun is setting already.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.640
Shut up.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:42.850
If you're that against it,
you can go home.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:45.380
You just collapsed earlier, didn't you?

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:50.970
I won't do it.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.340
I see.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:56.370
I'd feel uneasy drawing under such a self-centred woman.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:57.430
Perhaps so.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:02.150
Also, in April, I'll be in third year of high school, and I'll be graduating next year.

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:03.390
And...

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.510
And in my current state...

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:07.230
You can't draw due to your slump?

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:15.660
That is the only point where I would be inclined to agree with Kousaka Akane.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:18.120
Why are you siding with someone like her?

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.390
Aren't you annoyed?

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.280
Anyway, think about it yourself,

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:31.570
and decide on your own what you want to do.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:34.310
I've been telling you all the time that I...

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:37.140
All you're saying is reasons you can't do it.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:37.970
Huh?

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:40.600
You haven't decided anything yet.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.080
What you want to do in the future, what you want to become.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:46.680
Whether you want to stay a creator, or...

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.230
Stop that!

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.020
Are you trying to make me go?

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.020
Are you trying to make me quit the circle?

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.620
That's not what I'm thinking.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.800
However...

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.580
Can you believe it?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.890
It's Fields Chronicle!

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:10.530
This series was popular even before I was born.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:13.720
Us two making the newest game...

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:16.420
Together with Kousaka Akane, too.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.510
I can't believe just how well done that proposal was!

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:24.110
I wonder what the game will turn out like.

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:27.030
Even in the worst case, it may turn out to be the best game of the series.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.700
And what's more!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.560
The great Kousaka Akane saying that I'm needed-

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.070
Sorry.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.080
You don't need to apologise for anything.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:43.580
Not for the fact that Kousaka Akane built the plan with the assumption that you would be participating,

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.980
nor for the fact that she called on me mostly just to draw you in.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:47.500
H-Hey!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:54.170
You asked me earlier whether I'm annoyed.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.260
That's...

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.100
Very well, I shall answer.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.010
I'm annoyed.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.600
Of course I'd be annoyed because of that!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:06.690
There's no way being basically called a supplement to you, a doujin artist who hasn't even published commercially,

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:09.940
wouldn't make me, a professional, feel anything!

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.710
So prepare yourself.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.960
Should you participate in this project,

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:31.460
I will defeat you head on.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.390
Huh?

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:36.100
And that is my declaration of intent.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.520
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.420
Later.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:42.480
What do you mean?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.560
That you'll join if I do?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:48.400
Well, I guess it's like that.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:52.230
And if I turn it down, you turn it down too?

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.990
If it comes to that, I wouldn't be accepted anyway.

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:57.060
What's that?!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.560
You're telling me to decide,

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.370
but then leave your own decision to me too?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:04.750
There was nothing for me to decide to begin with, Sawamura-san.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:05.520
Hey!

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:08.100
Wait, Kasumigaoka Utaha!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.460
Completely trolling others like that...

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:13.830
No way!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:21.220
<i>If possible, I would like to work together with her again.</i>

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:27.730
<i>Together with Kashiwagi Eri's pictures, I want to create a game which surpasses even Cherry Blessing.</i>

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:30.480
<i>After all,</i>

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:30.980
Kasumigaoka Utaha!

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:34.500
<i>my heart has already decided.</i>

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.490
What should I do?!

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:41.490
Akane-san.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:44.460
Akane-san, please wake up.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:45.990
Hm?

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:53.110
It appears your negotiations with those two broke down already.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.710
Who knows?

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:58.000
I told you.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.860
That if you were to approach those two,

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:03.280
you should first run it by the circle representative, Aki-kun.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.220
Like I care.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:12.770
I need them in order to make the kind of exciting game I came up with.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.610
I've heard that line somewhere before.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:22.810
I will make Fields Chronicle be reborn.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.760
Me, with those two.

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:35.480
Going for every possible person like that is the reason you have even more enemies in the scene than I do, Akane-san.

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.540
I'm happy to die like a dog when I can't sell any more.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.920
This world is the only place I can live in.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:47.410
I can't corner myself that much yet.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.770
If you're going for the top, it's just obvious.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.790
I want to be a bit more at ease.

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:57.520
With a little bit of room, and not too many bonds,

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.280
able to have fun with my friends.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.160
I see.

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.030
So you want to leave.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.420
Thank you very much for everything.

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:13.250
But Iori, be sure to remember.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.540
As long as you want to rise in the scene,

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.960
it will not be easy.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.690
Detested and beaten down,

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.630
you can only crawl upwards with dogged determination.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:27.410
Well, I was thinking I'd leave the bothersome parts to others,

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:30.890
and be more of a fixer myself!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:36.270
If only you had convenient partners like that,
who take on all the grunt work for themselves!

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:39.660
I'll join up with someone like you again,

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:44.060
an idiot who pushes forward without thinking about people around themselves while getting them involved.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.370
I see, you're wavering.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.790
I'm sorry.

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:58.720
I've also just started my new series.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.050
Not at all.

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:05.310
It's right for a creator to want to participate in an appealing project.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:07.590
However,

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:11.350
I'll make sure you do your work for us on schedule too.

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:16.650
If anything, authors who take on more jobs and have their work animated,

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.920
and so end up unable to continue their series,

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:21.150
are too many to count.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:25.200
I won't just abandon it, so please don't get depressed ahead of time.

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:30.940
So, what will you do about your circle?

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.030
You can't juggle three things at once, can you?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.300
I'm...

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.990
...graduating anyway.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:40.130
What if Aki-kun cries and clings on to you?

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.550
"Even after you graduate,

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.960
please always stay with me!",

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:46.100
he'd say.

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:49.140
I'm a professional, after all.

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:51.810
I won't let feelings affect my work.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:56.050
Though I do feel that you were bursting with feelings just the other day.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.830
Thank you for the coffee.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.350
I will have to excuse myself.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.400
So...

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:04.480
Was Akane fine?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.180
Are you acquaintances?

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:11.540
We were in the same manga club in university.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:15.080
We haven't really met after starting work, though.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:20.000
Which means she'll be my university senpai?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.190
Don't sound that disgusted about it.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:25.460
She's way your senpai in the scene too, after all.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:30.700
I think it's impossible not to dislike someone who has such an unreasonable attitude towards yourself.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:34.890
Well, it's all because she's a pure creator.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:39.440
To me, she only looked like a thoroughly corrupted, crooked producer.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:42.310
Well, she certainly is sleazy,

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.840
does whatever it takes to reach her goal,

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:47.740
doesn't consider others' circumstances at all...

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.940
Isn't that just a questionable producer?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:53.150
But it's not for the sake of money,

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.330
nor for the sake of status or prestige.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:59.420
She's simply fanned by the passion of creating.

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:02.620
Even though she has acquired such money and status?

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:07.170
Well, you'll see it after tagging along with that monster for a while.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:11.220
Will I really be able to do it with someone like her?

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.930
It's difficult to say.

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:17.790
To get along with her, or rather, to fight her,

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.890
you need considerable abilities or mental strength,

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.650
or preferably both, or you can't contest her.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.070
That... may be true.

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:28.550
Can you do it, Shi-chan?

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.860
<i>I could just about deal with it by myself.</i>

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.360
<i>However...</i>

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.430
K-Kasumigaoka Utaha?

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:53.920
Sawamura-san?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.880
U-Um, do you have a moment?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.470
Do you know what time it is?

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.920
3 pm, right?

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:08.870
I see.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.870
Sorry to suddenly call you here.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.460
It's fine.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:22.080
I have nothing to do before my graduation anyway.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.580
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:29.840
You said so earlier, didn't you?

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:32.310
That I can't draw not because of a slump,

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:34.560
but simply because I'm crappy?

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:38.760
Though I believe it wasn't me but Kousaka Akane who said that.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.100
But you agreed with what she said!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.940
You said my pictures were bad!

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.690
Whatever you say.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:51.660
If you can't draw to begin with, whether you're good or bad-

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.110
Wait, Sawamura-san?

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:56.750
Could it be...

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.950
You can draw again?

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.710
I feel like I pretty much got my touch back.

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:05.250
Really?!

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.520
I was sketching yesterday at home, and before I knew it-

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:08.570
Sketching?!

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.490
Where are they?

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:10.510
Show me!

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:11.840
They're not here.

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.410
I left them at home.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:17.170
You really are useless, you piece of junk.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.050
Hey!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:21.070
Why do you have to go that far?!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.610
Can't be helped, then.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.070
Let's go.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.480
Huh, where?

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:26.940
Isn't it obvious?

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:28.720
To look at those sketches!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:29.900
At your home!

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:31.230
Why?

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.560
"Why"?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.900
You little...

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.700
It's faster than going to get them.

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:41.600
What is?

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:52.090
Drawing from scratch.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.160
<i>That's right.</i>

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.770
<i>You've come this far!</i>

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:11.420
<i>You came here quickly, skilfully and steadily!</i>

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.480
<i>So for the next thing, become amazing!</i>

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:17.180
<i>Show everyone that you can become amazing quickly, skilfully and steadily!</i>

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.290
<i>Don't push yourself too hard!</i>

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.660
<i>Come o-</i>

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.360
<i>Someone suddenly falling ill and the development deadline...</i>

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:32.500
<i>Isn't it obvious which you'd pick?</i>

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:45.640
<i>Well, you can draw it whenever you feel like it.</i>

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:51.250
<i>Are you kidding me, you scribbler?!</i>

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:54.030
<i>You're not in a slump or anything!</i>

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:57.110
It's done!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:03.310
So who's crappy now?

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.740
You are one...

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.370
I can draw!

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.150
I can overcome my slump!

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:12.770
I'll bust through the level Kousaka Akane is looking for in an instant!

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.670
I believe you.

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:15.380
No.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:19.070
Seeing this, I can only believe in you.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:24.840
Finally you recognise me, Kasumigaoka Utaha!

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:41.400
Sawamura-san?

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:45.620
Tomoya wanted it, Tomoya cheered me on,

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.620
but I still couldn't draw...

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:51.910
And yet,

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:55.610
when Kousaka Akane just denied me,

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.710
when Kousaka Akane just laughed at me,

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:02.650
I was so frustrated and embarrassed I didn't want to lose,

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.970
I drew!

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.930
Sawamura-san...

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:07.860
I...

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.730
I can't draw next to Tomoya,

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:15.200
and Tomoya can't make me draw.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:21.240
If I stay in the circle like before, I can't progress any further.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:28.150
I can't become the amazing illustrator Tomoya wants!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:52.350
I betrayed Tomoya when we were children.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:53.430
I know.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:57.100
So this is my second betrayal.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.690
This time Tomoya won't forgive me.

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:02.140
Well, maybe so.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:06.910
But unfortunately, this time you have an accomplice.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:09.080
Even if it hurts, you won't be alone.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:10.700
Am I not right?

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:16.330
Kasumigaoka Utaha...

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:20.970
Still, I'm sure that we'll have a hard time for a while, both of us.

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:22.810
I'm prepared.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:26.570
Well, if you feel like crying your eyes out, call out to me.

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.850
I can at least lend you my shoulder.

00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:30.540
I won't cry any more.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.280
There's no way it's fine for me to cry.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.910
You don't need to hold back now.

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:42.060
More importantly, you be prepared too.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.310
Well, I will be a university student soon,

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.270
so I can take care of you-

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.360
That's not what I mean!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.160
I mean yourself!

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:54.120
Don't let Kousaka Akane make light of you, Kasumi Utako!

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.650
You're a pro like her, right?

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:57.830
Sawamura-san...

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.380
She overlooked one thing.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:05.260
Your talent, your effort, your persistence!

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:10.430
Kousaka Akane, who doesn't even understand Kasumi Utako's greatness,

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:12.580
is no big deal!

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:27.710
Together, we two will defeat Kousaka Akane.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.580
And you too,

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:38.200
be careful I don't catch you off guard.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:47.590
I see.

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:50.590
So those two ended up quitting after all.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.120
Sorry about that.

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:54.580
You even warned me.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:57.880
No, I guess I should be the one to apologise.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.310
That's not true.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:03.980
But the reason Akane-san got interested in them was that I-

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:05.020
Iori.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:10.340
You know, this is an amazing opportunity for Eriri and Utaha-senpai.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:13.240
Wouldn't it be weird to complain about such great picks?

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:16.440
But they are your circle's...

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:20.500
That's right, I originally dragged them in to make a game.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:26.020
So isn't this proof of my great abilities as a producer?

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:32.080
So try to look a bit happier, then.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:41.440
Speaking of which, there's also something I need to announce.

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.900
What is it?

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:46.480
Izumi and I quit rouge en rouge.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:50.580
If that was out of consideration for me after they headhunted my members, that's not-

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.860
It's unrelated to that.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.870
I just found something new I want to do.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.650
Something I couldn't do in my current circle.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:03.530
Well, you can get by anywhere, so it's fine.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.000
But be sure to take good care of Izumi-chan.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.510
It's fine!

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:11.400
We've already found a place where Izumi can best demonstrate her skills!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.260
I see.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.010
So you continue your circle too.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.960
You said the same thing last time we met too, didn't you?

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:21.680
I'll say it as many times as it takes.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:23.570
Don't stop making games.

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:25.240
Don't stop producing new things.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:29.440
You can't stop pursing your dream.

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:32.360
Why are you that serious about it?

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:33.910
We're enemies, aren't we?

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:39.240
If you're not serious about it, it won't be fun for me either.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:40.810
I don't get you.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.310
<i>As if, you idiot!</i>

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:05.770
<i>I'd give that plan zero points.</i>

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:11.030
<i>From now on, I'm Kashiwagi Eri of your circle.</i>

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:15.400
<i>Welcome to the world of creators, Aki Tomoya-kun.</i>

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:18.910
<i>No matter who says what, I'll finish all the art for it.</i>

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:24.540
<i>Our completely original scenario.</i>

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.530
Katou...

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:09.710
It's been a while.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:12.160
You- your hair...

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.380
Let's go on a date.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:19.630
Let's try a date, the two of us.
